  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b201abe25cebddba89686adfbadd3afa0b72eb4b.png\" alt=\"Logo\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://count.getloli.com/@:Spartan-Weaponry?name=:Spartan-Weaponry&theme=minecraft&padding=7&offset=0&align=top&scale=1&pixelated=1&darkmode=auto\" alt=\":Spartan-Weaponry\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ASVG5n5xAg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1356601495289729034?label=Discord&logo=discord&color=7289DA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.mai-xiyu.top%252fen%252fspartan_weaponry_unofficial%252fintro%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Wiki-Spartan_Weaponry_Unofficial-2980b9?style=flat-square&logo=Wikipedia\" alt=\"Wiki\"></a></p>\n<h1>⚔️ Spartan Weaponry Unofficial (NeoForge)</h1>\n<p><strong>非官方社区移植版 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry</a>，适用于 Minecraft 1.21.1。</strong></p>\n<p>由于原作者（ObliviousSp）已超过六个月未活跃，本项目将原始代码适配至 <strong>NeoForge 1.21.1</strong>，让玩家可以在最新版本中享受斯巴达军械库的丰富武器。</p>\n<h2>✨ 特性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>庞大的军械库：</strong>添加了多种多样的武器，包括长柄武器、钝器、重剑以及远程武器（长弓、弩、飞刀）。</li>\n<li><strong>独特机制：</strong>武器拥有自定义属性，如破甲、横扫攻击和不同的攻击速度。</li>\n<li><strong>材质支持：</strong>完全兼容原版材质及常见模组矿石（铜、锡、青铜、钢等）。</li>\n<li><strong>现代化重构：</strong>专门为 <strong>1.21.1</strong> 上的 <strong>NeoForge</strong> 生态系统重新构建。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🛠️ 需求与兼容性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>平台：</strong>NeoForge 1.21.1</li>\n<li><strong>推荐模组：</strong>* <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcurios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios API</a>（用于箭袋槽位）</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a> / <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a>（查看合成配方）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>📜 致谢与许可</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>原作者：</strong><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.curseforge.com/members/oblivioussp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ObliviousSp</a></li>\n<li><strong>移植者：</strong>Mai_xiyu &amp; Claude AI</li>\n<li><strong>许可证：</strong>Apache-2.0</li>\n</ul>\n<p>⚠️ <strong>注意：</strong>这是一个<strong>非官方</strong>分支。请在此项目页面报告错误，<strong>不要</strong>联系原作者。</p>",
